<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.69 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.69 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.69 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.15 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     March 26		March 25</p>
<p> High			     74.6900		 75.1000</p>
<p> Low				75.1000		 75.2000</p>
<p> Open			     75.1000		 75.1000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6900		 75.1500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     7.580		   4.165</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
